  "releaseNotes": "- [Sg] Heap: bulk-upload fix — derive OUTPUT regions (GPU-written, never staged) punched a hole into every part's staged range, so a bulk arena flush degenerated into one Write call per part (~60us each; 68 s for 1.5 GB at 700k parts). Ranges now merge across small gaps (staging is the authoritative mirror, so gap bytes are harmless): 300k Write calls -> 1, upload 26x faster, first-frame ingest at 700k parts ~99 s -> ~33 s. Render times unchanged.",
